ignup growth' }}\n\n## 🔗 Quick Links\n\n- [User Dashboard](https://atlasai.com/admin/users)\n- [Revenue Analytics](https://atlasai.com/admin/revenue)\n- [Usage Monitoring](https://atlasai.com/admin/usage)\n- [Support Tickets](https://atlasai.com/admin/support)\n\n---\n*This report is automatically generated every Monday at 9:00 AM*\n*Atlas AI Analytics System*",
